'''Marshmallow Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating any stage from the [[War on Valentines#War on Valentines|War on Valentines]] event. It was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 176
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Marshmallow Cat
|name2 = Creepmallow
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Creepmallow''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Marshmallow Cat shows very little use outside of [[Empire of Cats]], as it is outclassed by even [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]], who sports a higher range, shorter cooldown and foreswing, shorter time between attacks, and lower cost. However, his main usage is for the [[Gross!!! (Combo)|Gross!!!]] combo, which increases the duration of freeze. This is very useful for units like [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] and [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], as it allows them to perma-freeze enemies more easily.

{{Job|Classification = Combo Slave}}

