==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Marshmallow Cat was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Grocery Cart (Removed Combo)|Grocery Cart]].
*Despite not having a [[True Form]] in The Battle Cats, Marshmallow Cat has a third form in [[Nyanko Defence Force]], which looks like Creepmallow holding a box of chocolates.
*Not counting [[:Category:Collaboration Event Cats|Collaboration Cats]], Marshmallow Cat is the oldest existing Rare Cat without a [[True Form]].

